+      # Tunix declares `RLTrainerPayload.metadata` with `pytree_node=False`, so its
+      # contents are part of the treedef rather than the leaves, and batch assembly writes
+      # per-microbatch values into it (`trajectory_ids`, `lineage`). A `gen_model_input_fn`
